ecke = decomp.hecke`),\nmatching the presentation in `knot-eigenbasis-complete-proof.lean`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.surjective","kind":"theorem","line":275,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L275-L275","doc":"**Surjectivity**: every link is the closure of some braid. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.closure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.closure","kind":"def","line":272,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L272-L272","doc":"Braid closure map β ↦ β̂. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.Braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.Braid","kind":"def","line":270,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L270-L270","doc":"Type of braids (union over all B_n). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.Link","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.Link","kind":"def","line":268,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L268-L268","doc":"Type of oriented links in S³. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L266-L266","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.AlexanderSurjectivity","kind":"structure","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L263-L275","doc":"**Alexander's theorem**: every oriented link in S³ is the closure\nβ̂ of some braid β ∈ B_n for some n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.complete","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.complete","kind":"theorem","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L260-L260","doc":"**Completeness**: every element of V^⊗n lies in the image of some\nsummand embedding. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.summand_embed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.summand_embed","kind":"def","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L255-L255","doc":"Embedding of each summand V_μ ⊗ S_μ into V^⊗n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.S_irrep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.S_irrep","kind":"def","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L253-L253","doc":"Irreducible H_n(q)-module for partition μ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.V_irrep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.V_irrep","kind":"def","line":251,"sourceLink":"https://github.c