.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.n_eq","kind":"theorem","line":241,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L241-L241","doc":"Consistency: same n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.hecke","kind":"def","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L239-L239","doc":"The Hecke algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.n","kind":"def","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L237-L237","doc":"Number of tensor factors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L235-L235","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.SchurWeylDecomposition","kind":"structure","line":232,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CasimirShared.lean#L232-L261","doc":"**q-Schur–Weyl decomposition** of V^⊗n under the joint action\nof SU_q(2) and the Hecke algebra H_n(q). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.spin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.spin","kind":"def","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/l